  "scope": "Owned versioned file-dialog replies and their UI-frame transaction, prerequisite for ADR015 independent B/A task windows; native B/A hosting remains open.",
  "implementation": [
    "Each route has an independent monotone generation. Replacement/cancel/shutdown retires the registry owner; callbacks retain CPU requests with no app/window/UI pointer.",
    "One atomic completion owns copied bounded UTF-8 path/status; UI polls only the currently owned request and destroys transferred paths. No SDL user event allocation/post survives shutdown.",
    "Poll the file worker before applying dialog results so closing a picker and updating its owner happen before one next UI frame.",
    "Successful project/workspace changes retire add-file, add-folder, import and batch-resume requests; independent project-parent requests survive."
  ],
